[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9544.229, "timestamp": "02:39:04", "text": "我的天啊。哇。哦好的。至少在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9547.51, "timestamp": "02:39:07", "text": "至少我们知道怎么做……呃……我们……呃……我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9549.03, "timestamp": "02:39:09", "text": "我们知道必须制造黄金工具。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9551.429, "timestamp": "02:39:11", "text": "现在。没错，黄金工具。没有石器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9553.79, "timestamp": "02:39:13", "text": "显然在这个游戏中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9567.19, "timestamp": "02:39:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9569.91, "timestamp": "02:39:29", "text": "什么是 versus？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9571.75, "timestamp": "02:39:31", "text": "哦，我觉得我们就像赢了一样。我们赢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9574.95, "timestamp": "02:39:34", "text": "你想试试吗？当然可以。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9578.229, "timestamp": "02:39:38", "text": "那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9585.349, "timestamp": "02:39:45", "text": "好的。我想，哦，我们像在遥远的地方一样繁衍生息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9588.79, "timestamp": "02:39:48", "text": "彼此之间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9591.03, "timestamp": "02:39:51", "text": "嗯，我想我们彼此之间都在竞争。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9593.11, "timestamp": "02:39:53", "text": "或许还有其他选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9594.87, "timestamp": "02:39:54", "text": "哦，这是像速通赛那样吗？谁会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9598.71, "timestamp": "02:39:58", "text": "能不能找到更多好工具？"}]